    "created_at": "2025-02-26T02:21:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-26T02:21:54Z",
    "body": "This looks good, although since we have decided on 1A instead of 2A, I wonder if we should have some sort of normative guidance in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-dom-interfaces.html#using-reflect-in-specifications to avoid using DOMString? for non-enumerated attributes.",
