    "created_at": "2025-02-26T07:37:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-02-26T07:37:18Z",
    "body": "It would probably be good to have some more detailed advice on attribute design in general, but I would not really want to block this PR on that as this seems like a strict improvement over not having anything.\r\n\r\nIt's also quite nuanced as I don't think we generally prefer `DOMString?` even if the attribute is enumerated, as generally it seems preferable to have an explicit state over null.",
